<title>USA: Taco Cabana Inc Q4 net shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Taco Cabana Inc Q4 net shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the 13 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>						 Dec. 29,	  Dec. 31,</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p>     Total revenues		     31,814,000     33,092,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)			 (698,000)	  441,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS) PER SHARE		(0.04)	     0.03</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>						15,706,537     15,730,854</p>
<p>						    For the Year Ended</p>
<p>						 Dec. 29,	  Dec. 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p>     Total revenues		    132,196,000    138,533,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)			   704,000    (3,798,000)</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS) PER SHARE		  0.04	   (0.24)</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>						15,694,757     15,648,624</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 net shr includes an after-tax charge of $1.75 million, or $0.11 per share, related to its decision to write down its investment in a joint venture. Excluding the charge, Q4 operating shr was a profit of $0.07.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
